  "about": "The solar-verify that exports a loop function's spec (tools/certify/loop_final.py spec_exporter): an immutable copy of O6's binary, checked by SHA-256; the shared checkout's solar-verify lacks O6's spec-scope fixes (review 189). Built with cargo build --locked -p solar-verify --bin solar-verify (debug, local, no SHIPPY_REMOTE) in the tree at the commit, cargo reporting it fresh, then copied read-only to binary. Debug builds are not reproducible across machines and caches, so nothing rebuilds it at run time.",
